00:41:29.880 --> 00:41:39.590
<v Ira Glass>My producer and I drove there one late and particularly cold night in February. The bridge is part of a six-lane highway, the Julia Tuttle Causeway, which crosses the Biscayne Bay.
<v Ira Glass>我和我的制片人在二月一个深夜，在那天特别冷的时候开车过去。这座桥是六车道公路的一部分，朱莉娅·塔特尔堤道，它横跨比斯坎湾。

00:41:39.590 --> 00:41:43.810
<v Isaiah Thompson>Put on your turn signal and then see if you can get over. I know it sounds crazy.
<v Isaiah Thompson>打上转向灯，看看能不能拐过去。我知道听起来很疯狂。

