<v Voncel Johnson>Yes, I was thinking it's a treatment center or something. I didn't know the difference. I'm saying, and then you bring me down on this bridge. He just told me and aunty to follow behind her, and she was going to take us to this place.
<v Voncel Johnson>是的，我以为是一个治疗中心什么的。我不知道区别。我说，然后你把我带到这座桥上。他只是告诉我，让我跟在她后面，她会把我们带到这个地方。

00:46:28.350 --> 00:46:32.290
<v Isaiah Thompson>So you actually, the night that you showed up, she was with you, your probation officer?
